// The developer's preview clips: the Universal Animation Library's 86 clips on the people's two
// skeletons, for the animation browser and the build crews. Their rig is not source: it is the
// "preview" set of the rigs' file (everglade/model/rigs.vrg, a VRG1 file; GitHub #13306), which a
// pack carries in its rig entry and everglade/scene/rig-asset.coax reads into a Preview. This file
// holds what code names: the clips' numbers and names, their seconds, the frames each bakes to, and
// the rig's shape. everglade/model/tools/rig-pack.coax --check holds the counts and the seconds to
// the file.
